Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Restore Compatibility Mode on 5.1.8: revert 875c0d0a and
 b2b0051d

Reverts the two commits that removed rootless package visibility and
the rootless-to-roothide adapter, on top of v5.1.8. Conflicts merged:
5.x origins filtering, Stripe recommendation, empty-catalogue handling,
CLI options, repack and icli 1.0.0 kept; adapter, Patch step, alerts,
Compatibility Updates setting and refusal list restored. Not yet built
or tested.
